Mon Nov  9 18:13:10 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.14:
  * Fix update() mutating its positional argument
  * setdefault() now keeps attributes in sync, including nested
    mappings
  * Subclasses of list, tuple and dict are no longer
    auto-converted
- Drop CHANGES from %doc: no longer shipped in the sdist
- Switch to the setuptools_scm-based build (upstream dropped
  setup.py); pin the tagged version via
  SETUPTOOLS_SCM_PRETEND_VERSION

